### Path-Specific Rules

Rules auto-load when you touch matching files:
- `packages/contracts/**`: schema validation and backward-compatibility warnings
- `integrations/agent-adapters/content/templates/**`: template editing workflow reminders
- `integrations/agent-adapters/content/<runner>/**`: synchronized files; edit their templates instead
- `packages/dev-tools/**`: build workflow and workspace conventions
- `.pipeline/**`, `packages/engine/**`: pipeline state and engine guidance
- `docs/**`: link validation reminders

## Architecture Overview

This repository implements a phased orchestration pipeline with 10 delivery stages:

```
arm -> design -> adversarial-review -> plan -> pmatch -> build -> quality-static -> quality-tests -> post-build -> release-readiness
```

Two layers:
- Orchestration adapters (`integrations/agent-adapters/content/<runner>/skills/`): runner guidance for Codex, Cursor, Claude, Gemini, and Kilo, synchronized from templates by `integrations/agent-adapters/src/generate-adapters.ts`.
- Runtime skills (`packages/dev-tools/`): Node.js packages that perform validation, review, and trace collection at runtime.

